# fcis-coder with a 64K context window, for running Claude Code on a local
# model (`ollama launch claude --model fcis-coder-64k`). Ollama's Claude Code
# integration docs recommend 64k+ context; fcis-coder ships with 32768.
# Everything else (system prompt, sampling) is inherited.
#
# RENDERER/PARSER replace the GGUF's embedded Jinja chat template, which raises
# "System message must be at the beginning" on Claude Code's mid-conversation
# system messages. Ollama's qwen3.8 renderer merges them into the leading
# system block instead (ollama model/renderers/qwen38_test.go). There is no
# qwen3.8 parser; Qwen-family models use qwen3.5.
FROM fcis-coder
PARAMETER num_ctx 65536
RENDERER qwen3.8
PARSER qwen3.5
